      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_5_404-470",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "404-470",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "知己知彼①，将心比心②。",
      "totalCount": 204
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 54122031,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_8_404-448",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "404-448",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "相逢好似初相识①，到老终无怨恨心。",
      "totalCount": 204
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 13196094,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_6_404-444",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "404-444",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "酒逢知己饮，诗向会人吟①。",
      "totalCount": 156
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 13196094,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_7_404-444",
      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "404-444",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "相识满天下，知心能几人①？",
      "totalCount": 150
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 237752486,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_18_405-421",
      "chapterUid": 18,
      "range": "405-421",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "当时若不登高望，谁信东流海洋深。",
      "totalCount": 136
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 68394342,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_22_405-449",
      "chapterUid": 22,
      "range": "405-449",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "马行无力皆因瘦，人不风流只为贫①。",
      "totalCount": 119
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 218855648,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_39_405-449",
      "chapterUid": 39,
      "range": "405-449",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "古人不见今时月，今月曾经照古人①。",
      "totalCount": 119
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 31771069,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_13_1120-1148",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "1120-1148",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "当然，这样的交往方式显得不够坦诚，也会带来社交上的障碍。",
      "totalCount": 112
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 299687654,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_55_405-457",
      "chapterUid": 55,
      "range": "405-457",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "力微休负重，言轻莫劝人①。无钱休入众，遭难莫寻亲。",
      "totalCount": 112
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 44018249,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_3_2215-2234",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "2215-2234",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "见事莫说，问事不知。闲事莫管，无事早归",
      "totalCount": 108
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 8940572,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_14_940-984",
      "chapterUid": 14,
      "range": "940-984",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "只有积极地去实践，才可能产生意想不到的收获。插柳虽无意，但也总是要先插，然后才可能成荫。",
      "totalCount": 108
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 911021833,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_26_405-477",
      "chapterUid": 26,
      "range": "405-477",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "莺花犹怕春光老①，岂可教人枉度春②？",
      "totalCount": 102
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 20646059,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_221_406-414",
      "chapterUid": 221,
      "range": "406-414",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "见者易，学者难。",
      "totalCount": 96
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 53183595,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_10_404-448",
      "chapterUid": 10,
      "range": "404-448",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "易涨易退山溪水，易反易覆小人心①。",
      "totalCount": 90
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 2917483,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_16_405-473",
      "chapterUid": 16,
      "range": "405-473",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "钱财如粪土①，仁义值千金②。",
      "totalCount": 90
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 28406296,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_44_405-445",
      "chapterUid": 44,
      "range": "405-445",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "大家都是命①，半点不由人。",
      "totalCount": 90
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 43126711,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_119_406-450",
      "chapterUid": 119,
      "range": "406-450",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "儿孙自有儿孙福，莫为儿孙作马牛①。",
      "totalCount": 90
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300038226",
      "userVid": 3134024,
      "bookmarkId": "3300038226_34_405-461",
      "chapterUid": 34,
      "range": "405-461",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "有钱道真语，无钱语不真。不信但看筵中酒①，杯杯先劝有钱人。",
      "totalCount": 84
    }
